      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-024.mp3",
        "text": "交给我吧！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/jaan01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-025.mp3",
        "text": "微笑——光束！！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/gattsu01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-026.mp3",
        "text": "成功了！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-028.mp3",
        "text": "都是多亏了纱夜！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-030.mp3",
        "text": "不过，这里的怪比活动的时候要好打得多啊！\n这也是因为我进步了吗？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-033.mp3",
        "text": "原来是这样啊！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf03.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-034.mp3",
        "text": "哎呀？\n那边的是……"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/gattsu01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-036.mp3",
        "text": "是小豆泥！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf03.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-038.mp3",
        "text": "哎呀？"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nod01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-039.mp3",
        "text": "嗯嗯"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf04.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-041.mp3",
        "text": "纱夜，小豆泥好像也想和我们\n一起做任务！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/gattsu01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-044.mp3",
        "text": "小豆泥，我们一起加油吧！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf03.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_01-051.mp3",
        "text": "猫——"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf03.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-005.mp3",
        "text": "小豆泥，你是想让那只猫露出笑容吗！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-006.mp3",
        "text": "好，那我也来帮忙！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-009.mp3",
        "text": "嘿、嘿！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/sad01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-010.mp3",
        "text": "不行啊……天一黑马上就找不到敌人了……"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/surprised01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-015.mp3",
        "text": "呀！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-017.mp3",
        "text": "我没事，可是小豆泥它——！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-020.mp3",
        "text": "不能放弃哦，纱夜！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-022.mp3",
        "text": "我想到了一个好主意！\n相信我吧！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-024.mp3",
        "text": "当然啦！\n小豆泥，跟我来！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-028.mp3",
        "text": "谢谢你，纱夜！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/gattsu01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-030.mp3",
        "text": "Happy!"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-032.mp3",
        "text": "Lucky!"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/kime01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-034.mp3",
        "text": "Smile!"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/jaan01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-036.mp3",
        "text": "光——束！！！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-040.mp3",
        "text": "呵呵！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf05.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-042.mp3",
        "text": "看来它们已经很要好了呢！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-044.mp3",
        "text": "是我的『快乐能量』起作用了哦！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/smile01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-047.mp3",
        "text": "对呀！我发现只要攒满『快乐能量』，\n就能发射光束了！用『Happy!Lucky!Smile!光束』，\n就能让怪兽和大家都笑容满面！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/oowarai01.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-051.mp3",
        "text": "呵呵呵！"
      },
      {
        "file": "../011_general_rip/nf02.mtn",
        "sound": "../../voices/band-cn-bili_res011001-CHS_Azukicollab2026_KO_02-052.mp3",
        "text": "来嘛，纱夜也一起玩吧！"
      }
    ],
